  "body": "Positioned on a substantial 2,002sqm (more or less) parcel and capturing panoramic views across Orewa and the estuary, this family residence offers a rare combination of scale, flexibility, and outstanding functionality. \r\n\r\nEngineers own home built to a high standard, the home showcases quality Linea weatherboard construction, generous proportions, and a thoughtful layout tailored for modern family living. At its heart, the expansive entertainer's kitchen features a fully equipped scullery, extensive storage, and seamless connection to multiple living and outdoor entertaining areas. \r\n\r\nWith five generous bedrooms, a dedicated office, multiple bathrooms, and a versatile loft space with full standing height, the home effortlessly accommodates large families, guests, or multigenerational living. \r\n\r\nA true point of difference is the impressive commercial-style garage of approximately 220sqm. Complete with high-stud clearance and extensive off-street parking, it offers the ultimate solution for vehicle collectors, tradies, boating enthusiasts, home businesses, or those requiring substantial storage. \r\n\r\nLarge decks extend the living spaces outdoors, while the expansive grounds offer room for fruit trees, landscaped gardens, a swimming pool, or simply space for the family to enjoy. \r\n\r\nLocated in a peaceful and highly sought-after setting, just moments from schools, shops, beaches, and motorway access, this remarkable property delivers the perfect balance of coastal lifestyle and practical luxury.",
